# Secrets and machine credentials must never enter this repository.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*credential*
**/*secret*
**/*token*
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
**/*.kubeconfig
**/auth.json
**/credentials.json

# Generated state, caches and downloaded binaries.
**/.DS_Store
**/.git/
**/.agents/
**/.codex/
**/node_modules/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.log
**/*.bak
**/*.backup-*
.sync.lock
home/.config/atuin/atuin-receipt.json
home/.config/zellij/plugins/
home/.config/spicetify/CustomApps/
home/.config/spicetify/Extensions/
